{"id":17899,"date":"2023-06-01T16:02:13","date_gmt":"2023-06-01T22:02:13","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/?post_type=news&#038;p=17899"},"modified":"2023-10-23T16:23:05","modified_gmt":"2023-10-23T22:23:05","slug":"newsletter-june-2023-vol-6-23","status":"publish","type":"news","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/news-events\/newsletter-june-2023-vol-6-23\/","title":{"rendered":"Newsletter: June 2023 (Vol 6.23)"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"17899\" class=\"elementor elementor-17899\" data-elementor-post-type=\"news\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1233fc4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1233fc4\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-14a0e26\" data-id=\"14a0e26\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8ced4d1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8ced4d1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom: 50px;\">We have lots going on this summer and we&#8217;re kicking it off in June with another free CE event and conference travel! Check out our updates below!<\/p><p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-15444 alignright\" style=\"margin-top: 0px;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/customer-appreciation-happy-hour-during-abai-conference-denver-rethinkbh.jpg\" alt=\"RethinkBH booth at ABAI conference in Denver\" width=\"400\" height=\"auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/customer-appreciation-happy-hour-during-abai-conference-denver-rethinkbh.jpg 459w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/customer-appreciation-happy-hour-during-abai-conference-denver-rethinkbh-300x260.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 459px) 100vw, 459px\" \/><\/p><h2 style=\"margin-top: 0px;\">We enjoyed seeing you at ABAI!<\/h2><p>Thanks to everyone who joined us for our Customer Appreciation Happy Hour during the ABAI conference in Denver.<\/p><p>We had a blast getting to know you and hearing your feedback.<\/p><p>Next stop: Nashville, TN for the Women in Behavior Analysis conference. Look out for more event invites coming soon!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-522c4b9 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"522c4b9\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-524ea51\" data-id=\"524ea51\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0548f40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0548f40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright\" style=\"margin-top: -7%; max-width: 315px !important; border-radius: 100%; padding: 15px;\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/rethinkbh-employee-spotlight-danielle-deschamps-customer-support-trainer.jpg\" alt=\"Danielle Deschamps, Customer Support Trainer, outside with husband and pet dog\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" \/><\/p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px; color: #ffffff;\">Employee Spotlight<\/h2><h3 style=\"margin-top: 15px; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold;\">Danielle Deschamps<em>, Customer Support Trainer<\/em><\/h3><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Lives in:<\/strong> New York, NY<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Family:<\/strong> My husband, Alex, dachshund named Hercules, and our soon to be first child! <\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>When you&#8217;re not at Rethink what are you doing? <\/strong>We love spending time in Central Park and hiking in the nearby areas.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite food: <\/strong>I love a good New York slice, however desserts are my absolute favorite. I am always down for a slice of tiramisu or a mochi donut.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong>Favorite vacation: <\/strong> Japan! We loved the scenery, hiking, food and fantastic people we met. I loved hiking Mt Hakone (an active volcano!) and getting to see Mt. Fuji.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5c13961 vertical-align-middle elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5c13961\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-15446 alignleft\"  style=\"margin-right: 30px\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/sun.webp\" alt=\"sun doodle\" width=\"100\" height=\"auto\" \/>\n<h2>June 2023 Events<\/h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-a26d23f elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a26d23f\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-a63d52b\" data-id=\"a63d52b\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec927dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"ec927dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/dr-keith-williams.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15448\" alt=\"Headshot of Dr. Keith Williams\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/dr-keith-williams.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/dr-keith-williams-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/dr-keith-williams-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4dc3100\" data-id=\"4dc3100\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf7f92d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cf7f92d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Selective Eating Among Children with Autism Spectrum Disorder<\/h3><p><strong>June 13th @ 1:00 pm ET<\/strong><\/p><p>In this episode of Our Next Guest, Dr. Keith Williams sits down with Dr. Bridget Taylor to discuss possible reasons for selective eating, the role of repeated exposure to taste preferences, and various interventions to increase diet variety in children with ASD.<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/selective-eating-among-children-asd\/\">Register for FREE CE Event<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-4a446b9 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"4a446b9\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4a58c19\" data-id=\"4a58c19\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57ef24a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"57ef24a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Artificial Intelligence in Applied Behavior Analysis<\/h3><p>Dr. David Cox has dedicated his career on research related to effectively leveraging technology, quantitative modeling, and the use of artificial intelligence to ethically optimize behavioral health outcomes and clinical decision-making. He joined the <em>ABA After Hours<\/em> podcast to talk about artificial intelligence and its implications within the field of ABA.\u00a0<\/p><p><a href=\"https:\/\/open.spotify.com\/show\/5mwABNOCk7yJH2Au02WpdF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Listen now wherever you get your podcasts!<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3d3f444\" data-id=\"3d3f444\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5974be6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5974be6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15088\" alt=\"ABA After Hours, A podcast presented by Rethink Behavioral Health\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health.jpg 600w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/02\/aba-after-hours-podcast-presented-by-rethink-behavioral-health-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-1c881ef elementor-section-content-middle elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"1c881ef\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-edc5675\" data-id=\"edc5675\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7720910 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7720910\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"386\" height=\"341\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/black-applied-behavior-analysts-logo.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-15450\" alt=\"BABA logo\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/black-applied-behavior-analysts-logo.png 386w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/06\/black-applied-behavior-analysts-logo-300x265.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 386px) 100vw, 386px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-e3dc50f\" data-id=\"e3dc50f\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc19545 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bc19545\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Black Applied Behavior Analysts conference<\/h3><p><strong>June 17th &#8211; 19th, Detroit, MI<\/strong><\/p><p>We&#8217;ll be in Detroit for the Black Applied Behavior Analysts conference this month! Stop by our booth to talk to our team, ask questions, and check out the swag and feature previews we have for you!<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-d20b422 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"d20b422\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-df088ce\" data-id=\"df088ce\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33842a7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"33842a7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>In Case You Missed It<\/h2>\nRethink has released 3 e-books t